## Letter from the CEO

Dear Stakeholders,

Fiscal Year 2024 was a transformational year for MedSync Health. We achieved record revenue of $156.8 million, representing 75.2% year-over-year growth, while simultaneously reaching GAAP profitability for the first time in our company's history.

Our mission to revolutionize healthcare through seamless data integration has never been more relevant. With 589 customers across hospitals, clinics, and insurance providers, we are now processing over 50 million patient records monthly through our platform.

Key highlights from FY 2024 include:

- **Revenue growth of 75.2%** to $156.8M (from $89.5M in FY 2023)
- **First profitable year** with net income of $3.8M
- **Customer base expansion** from 412 to 589 customers
- **Launch of MedSync Payor** in June 2024, our fourth product line
- **Successful Series D raise** of $200M at a $2.4B valuation
- **Team growth** to 1,200 employees across 4 global offices

As we look toward FY 2025 and our planned IPO in Q4 2026, we remain focused on sustainable growth, product excellence, and building a world-class organization.

Thank you for your continued trust and partnership.

Dr. Elena Rodriguez
Chief Executive Officer & Co-Founder

